s://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/615-the-hanged-man","name":"The Hanged Man","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-30T19:27:25-07:00","id":102311,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/25163-what-lunar-charms-do-you-expect-will-or-will-not-return?p=102297#post102297\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sense-Borrowing Method. Do you think it will return?<br /> <br /> Honestly, I was never entirely sure why the Lunar Exalted had this in the first place. The Dragon-Blooded had it before them, and it made sense given the Terrestrial emphasis on team-work and buffing effects.<br /> <br /> I wonder if it fits the &quot;physical, stylistically barbarian&quot; aesthetic that the developers are going for?</div> </div> </div> </div>I do have my doubts. I suppose it could be a shamanic thing, but it'd need some rewriting to get people to think of it that way.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-30T20:09:34-07:00","id":102339,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bb